@baseUrl = http://localhost:80/api/auth

### 1. Registrar un Nuevo Usuario (Admin)
# @name registerAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "carnet": "202203856",
    "nombres": "Alvaro",
    "apellidos": "Guzman",
    "correo": "alvaro@test.com",
    "password": "mypassword",
    "rol": "Admin"
}

### 2. Iniciar Sesión
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "carnet": "202203856",
    "password": "mypassword"
}

### Variable que guarda el token JWT extraído automáticamente del login
@authToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 3. Validar Token (Simula lo que haría el API Gateway u otro microservicio)
POST {{baseUrl}}/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
